  "description": "Thundering Skies is a shoot'em up inspired by the 16-bit classics of the genre. Making an appearance are the obligatory fire and ice-themed levels, giant battleships, scratchy voice samples, huge bosses and overpowered weapons that make you feel naked when you lose them - as well some less expected features.\n\r\n\n\r\nIncludes:\n\r\n\n\r\n- 6 stages\n\r\n- 2 game modes: autosave your progress or beat it in one sit with limited credits for an extra score boost\n\r\n- 4 difficulty levels, including an introductory mode\n\r\n- 10 Steam Achievements\n\r\n- Challenging bosses and minibosses\n\r\n- Online score board\n\r\n- An amazing soundtrack by Bettina Calmon\n\r\n- Adjustable scanlines for that lovely CRT effect",
